        {
          "nodeId": "n_s24_mia",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "食堂门口。她没躲别人的目光。肩还皱着。",
          "assetId": "assets/scenes/ch04/S24-mia.webp",
          "artStatus": "ready",
          "camera": "hold",
          "transition": "fade",
          "fx": "warm-veil",
          "characters": [
            "kai",
            "mia"
          ],
          "artCue": "S24 半公开：Mia 接住旧名，不是安慰奖",
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "mia",
              "text": "「……笨蛋。叫我一声。」",
              "camera": "hold",
              "transition": "fade"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "text": "这一声她接住了。半边名分。不是安慰奖。",
              "camera": "hold",
              "transition": "fade"
            }
          ],
          "advance": "n_s24_tail",
          "setFlags": {
            "ending": "end_mia"
          }
        },
        {
          "nodeId": "n_s24_jade",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "合影位不空。她把你拉进框，闪光开着。",
          "assetId": "assets/scenes/ch04/S24-jade.webp",
          "artStatus": "ready",
          "camera": "hold",
          "transition": "fade",
          "fx": "warm-veil",
          "characters": [
            "kai",
            "jade"
          ],
          "artCue": "S24 进框：Jade 故意留他",
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "jade",
              "text": "「这下他们看清楚了。」",
              "camera": "hold",
              "transition": "fade"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "text": "浅。真。",
              "camera": "hold",
              "transition": "fade"
            }
          ],
          "advance": "n_s24_tail",
          "setFlags": {
            "ending": "end_jade"
          }
        },
        {
          "nodeId": "n_s24_vanessa",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "檐下。地面是干的。雨已经下过了。",
          "assetId": "assets/scenes/ch04/S24-vanessa.webp",
          "artStatus": "ready",
          "camera": "hold",
          "transition": "fade",
          "fx": "vignette",
          "characters": [
            "kai",
            "vanessa"
          ],
          "artCue": "S24 裂缝：干檐，非雨吻，非女友DLC",
          "lines": [
            {
              "speaker": "vanessa",
              "text": "「我没倒向你。——还没。」",
              "camera": "hold",
              "transition": "fade"
            },
            {
              "speaker": "narrator",
              "text": "裂了。Troy 的影还在。不是抢成。",
              "camera": "hold",
              "transition": "fade"
            }
          ],
          "advance": "n_s24_tail",
          "setFlags": {
            "ending": "end_vanessa"
          }
        },
        {
          "nodeId": "n_s24_crash",
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "楼道空着。群还在转那两张图。",
          "assetId": "assets/scenes/ch04/S24-crash.webp",
          "artStatus": "ready",
          "camera": "hold",
          "transition": "fade",
          "fx": "vignette",
          "characters": [
